  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administration of Equity Investment in E Green Global Co. Ltd.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">E Green Global Co. Ltd. (EGG) is an agricultural technology (agritech) company that has built the world&apos;s first mass production platform for successfully commercializing non-genetically modified, high-quality virus-free potato microtubers (MCTs). EGG&apos;s mission to strengthen food security through less resource-intensive potato farming practices aligns with ADB&apos;s operational priorities (OPs) of accelerating progress in gender equality, promoting rural development and greater food security; and tackling climate change, building climate and disaster resilience, and enhancing environmental sustainability in Asia and the Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
